    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Timed shake\nLock Plate -> Start Shaking -> Wait (shake duration) -> Stop Shaking.\n\nThe node returns as soon as the API answers. The shake duration is the n8n Wait node, not the node.\n\nError branch: if Start Shaking, the Wait or Stop Shaking fails, the error output calls Stop All and then fails the execution. If Lock Plate fails, nothing was started, so the execution fails without a stop.\n\nRisk (OQ-4): if n8n itself stops between Start Shaking and Stop Shaking, the device keeps shaking until a stop arrives. Send Stop Shaking or Stop All by hand.\n\nDo not enable Continue On Fail on Stop All. Select your own QInstruments BioShake credential on every QInstruments BioShake node.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "7a2d3b20-0010-4d4f-8b62-3c8e1f000010",
